ng. It is on hold."], "lucky_charm_stamp_the_bad_luck_off": ["Out, bad luck. Out. Ow. My foot.", "Stamped it. It stayed. I limped."], "lucky_charm_rap_the_wood_too_hard_and_hurt_his_bill": ["Knocked on wood. Wood knocked back.", "Bill hurts. Luck, apparently, is pain."], "lucky_charm_leap_for_the_charm_and_land_on_his_tail": ["Landed on my tail. It is my tail's turn to complain.", "Missed by a mile. A tall mile."]},
